id: adapted-saibaman
name: Adapted Saibaman
order: 1
category: body
# "[Seedling Biology]": it replaces that Primary Racial Trait - which, the table's.
importance: primary
race: saibaman
# (1) Built as any Size from Tiny to Large instead of the Saibamen's Small - offered on the Progression tab (races.mjs creationSizesOf).
creationSizes: tiny, small, medium, large
# (2) Two Bestial Traits, each chosen as it is added - gone with it.
grantsOther: bestial
grantsOtherCount: 2
description: >
  Able to thrive in any environment, you’ve adapted to your new home, becoming something nearly unrecognizable.
text: >
  Adapted Saibaman (Body) [Seedling Biology]: Able to thrive in any environment, you’ve adapted to your new home, becoming something nearly unrecognizable.
  (1)-[Passive]: At Character Creation, your Size Category can be anything between Tiny and Large.
  (2)-[Passive]: Select and gain 2 Bestial Traits.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase your Racial Life Modifier by 2.
  (4)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: Regain Ki Points equal to x(bT) – where x is equal to your Racial Life Modifier (max. 7(bT)).

---

[passive]
# (3)
racialLifeModifier += 2;

# (4) Your turn begins: Ki Points by your Racial Life Modifier, 7 at most, each (bT). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/start-of-turn, effect 4]
ki.value += min(max(racialLifeModifier, 0), 7) * 1(bT);
